.SH 14. Maintenance — DONE
.LP
Основные команды:
.LP
.EX
wsflatpak list --app
wsflatpak update
wsflatpak cleanup
wsflatpak check
.EE
.PP
Практически проверено:
.LP
.EX
list       PASS
update     PASS
cleanup    PASS
check      PASS
.EE
.LP
\l'2i'
.SH 15. Current managed application baseline
.LP
Source of truth:
.LP
.EX
config/flatpak/apps.conf
.EE
.PP
На текущем verified baseline используются:
.LP
.EX
flathub  com.github.tchx84.Flatseal
flathub  org.gimp.GIMP
flathub  com.mikrotik.WinBox
flathub  com.anydesk.Anydesk
flathub  us.zoom.Zoom
